{"id":"n25302-1-8","stage":1,"title":"전부 · 全部","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25302-1-8-1","ko":"박 대리는 가끔 거짓말을 하는 것 같아.","zh":"朴代理好像偶尔会说谎。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"박","meaning":"朴（姓氏）","explanation":"박：朴（姓氏）","readings":[{"term":"박","audio":"/audio/a2ed2af4650eb11ce3b7.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"대리는","meaning":"代理","explanation":"대리：代理；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"대리","audio":"/audio/4e96b696526850f76e08.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48362","senseId":"2","lemma":"대리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가끔","meaning":"偶尔，有时，时而，间或","explanation":"가끔：偶尔，有时，时而，间或","readings":[{"term":"가끔","audio":"/audio/712074afaec5737d4bcb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65204","senseId":"1","lemma":"가끔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거짓말을","meaning":"谎言","explanation":"거짓말：谎言；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"거짓말","audio":"/audio/a142bcee838500ead54b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28444","senseId":"1","lemma":"거짓말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하는","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4e96b696526850f7","term":"대리","zh":"代理","audio":"/audio/4e96b696526850f76e08.mp3","entryId":"48362","definition":"公司中一般职员与课长之间的职位；或位居该职位的人。","pronunciation":["대ː리"]},{"id":"712074afaec5737d","term":"가끔","zh":"偶尔，有时，时而，间或","audio":"/audio/712074afaec5737d4bcb.mp3","entryId":"65204","definition":"不经常，偶然一次。","pronunciation":["가끔"]},{"id":"a142bcee838500ea","term":"거짓말","zh":"谎言","audio":"/audio/a142bcee838500ead54b.mp3","entryId":"28444","definition":"把非事实的事情编造成事实一样说的话。","pronunciation":["거ː진말"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/d5d7b7b52ffcafbc4350.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n25302-1-8-2","ko":"맞아. 그래서 박 대리의 말을 전부 믿을 수는 없어.","zh":"对。所以不能完全相信朴代理说的话。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"맞아.","meaning":"对","explanation":"맞다：对；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"3","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그래서","meaning":"因此，所以","explanation":"그래서：因此，所以","readings":[{"term":"그래서","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61169","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"박","meaning":"朴（姓氏）","explanation":"박：朴（姓氏）","readings":[{"term":"박","audio":"/audio/a2ed2af4650eb11ce3b7.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"대리의","meaning":"代理","explanation":"대리：代理；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"대리","audio":"/audio/4e96b696526850f76e08.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48362","senseId":"2","lemma":"대리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말을","meaning":"话，语言","explanation":"말：话，语言；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"2","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전부","meaning":"全部","explanation":"전부：全部","readings":[{"term":"전부","audio":"/audio/47f5c6ba3e704438d2c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25302","senseId":"1","lemma":"전부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"믿을","meaning":"信赖，依靠","explanation":"믿다：信赖，依靠；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"믿다","audio":"/audio/03fdf42bef953df48966.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69478","senseId":"2","lemma":"믿다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수는","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없어.","meaning":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","explanation":"없다：不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"对","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66231","definition":"正是或没错。","pronunciation":["맏따"]},{"id":"8df56b9bfbdae2fd","term":"그래서","zh":"因此，所以","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3","entryId":"61169","definition":"用于表示前面内容是后面内容的原因、依据或条件等。","pronunciation":["그래서"]},{"id":"4e96b696526850f7","term":"대리","zh":"代理","audio":"/audio/4e96b696526850f76e08.mp3","entryId":"48362","definition":"公司中一般职员与课长之间的职位；或位居该职位的人。","pronunciation":["대ː리"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"话，语言","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表达想法或感觉的行为或态度。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"47f5c6ba3e704438","term":"전부","zh":"全部","audio":"/audio/47f5c6ba3e704438d2c3.mp3","entryId":"25302","definition":"一个不漏全都。","pronunciation":["전부"]},{"id":"03fdf42bef953df4","term":"믿다","zh":"信赖，依靠","audio":"/audio/03fdf42bef953df48966.mp3","entryId":"69478","definition":"依赖某一对象，认为其不会辜负自己的寄望。","pronunciation":["믿따"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/55cb628cfb046d142f5f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.792,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=25302","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":51,"sequenceScore":2.2427,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["对。所以不能完全相信朴代理说的话。","怎么买了这么多糖果啊？","朴代理好像偶尔会说谎。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["对。所以不能完全相信朴代理说的话。","朴代理好像偶尔会说谎。","怎么买了这么多糖果啊？"],"answer":0}]}
